      "content": "i know it's not \"the reality\" but it's the math. i spend $2000 a month on rent/food/stuff that i'm not even bringing in anymore. i'm just a black hole for their money and energy. if i weren't here, she wouldn't have to worry about my medical bills or me being depressed... it just seems like i'm actually making their lives harder by staying.",
